SY_TALK("9R546Rpxr0U",[[12,["Yesterday I told you"]],[17,["that we have within us"]],[20,["two very important powers."]],[23,["The first power is the power of desire"]],[27,["by which we desire,"]],[29,["called as “iccha shakti” in Sanskrit language"]],[32,["and another power which is called"]],[37,["as the “kriya power,” or we can say the power of action."]],[43,["These two are really gross powers"]],[46,["which are expressed outside"]],[49,["as sympathetic nervous system."]],[54,["Left and Right sympathetic nervous system."]],[57,["The central path is called"]],[61,["the “Sushumna Nadi,” the channel of our ascent."]],[67,["This channel represents our evolution through ages."]],[74,["We can say that this channel is responsible"]],[77,["for giving us our evolution"]],[79,["from amoeba to this stage as a human being."]],[84,["And all the centers that you see there"]],[87,["– one, two, three, four, five, six and seven -"]],[91,["– all of them are the milestones in our progress,"]],[95,["in our evolution."]],[98,["These are all placed within us"]],[100,["the subtle centers are there, they are all there"]],[104,["and we are made up of this beautiful instrument."]],[108,["We are not aware of it, of course we are not aware."]],[111,["Also we can’t see them because they are subtle centers"]],[114,["and we cannot see with our naked eyes."]],[118,["We can only see the manifestation of these centers outside"]],[121,["as gross plexuses."]],[124,["Now today, as I told you yesterday,"]],[126,["I will be dealing with each center one by one"]],[129,["and I will tell you what these centers represent within us."]],[134,["The very first center is the center of our innocence."]],[142,["Before creating us, before creating this universe,"]],[145,["innocence was created."]],[147,["Innocence is the most powerful power on this earth."]],[151,["Innocence is Love, innocence is God"]],[154,["and innocence is the only thing that really"]],[158,["keeps us going in this horrible world in which we are born."]],[164,["This innocence we find in the matter."]],[171,["Matter is innocent."]],[173,["If you hit the matter it will hit you."]],[175,["If you don’t hit it, it is all right."]],[177,["You can change the form of the matter."]],[179,["You see, say for example, this hall - it won’t trouble you."]],[185,["If you are here it will give you shade."]],[187,["If you want you can use it for"]],[190,["disturbing others, for destroying others."]],[192,["The way you want to use it, you can use it,"]],[195,["because it doesn’t say anything to us."]],[197,["So at this center is the carbon element"]],[200,["which started doing within us."]],[202,["We can say the carbon is in the center"]],[204,["of the whole"]],[209,["system of elements."]],[211,["Carbon is in the center"]],[214,["because it is a tetravalent element."]],[217,["As you know it has got four valencies"]],[219,["and when carbon came in this existence,"]],[224,["then only life would be produced"]],[227,["and this center is thus,"]],[229,["is the center where we became really tetravalent –"]],[232,["means we became an element"]],[237,["by which we could become human beings."]],[240,["We could become the living things."]],[243,["The living things started when carbon came into existence."]],[247,["So this center is very important"]],[250,["because this center represents that stage of human evolution"]],[254,["where we became living human beings."]],[257,["Before this we were dead people,"]],[259,["we were just like these stones and things that you see around."]],[264,["After that -"]],[267,["I told you about this center yesterday -"]],[271,["After that you have the second center of our seeking."]],[275,["When an animal came into being he started seeking."]],[280,["First he started seeking the food."]],[282,["For example the unicellular animals like amoeba and all that"]],[287,["they just seek food."]],[288,["They do not seek anything else but food"]],[291,["and that is the beginning of our seeking."]],[295,["So the first, grossest seeking was food,"]],[298,["where we started seeking something for our growth,"]],[303,["for our nutrition."]],[306,["The second seeking started when some of the animals"]],[310,["felt that they were too big for their sizes,"]],[313,["they couldn’t move around and they found it impossible"]],[317,["to do something about it."]],[319,["Now we can say, that even before these animals were made,"]],[323,["before that the fishes themselves"]],[328,["were surrounded by land"]],[330,["and one of the fishes had to come up,"]],[332,["the future that was going to happen."]],[336,["In these chaotic conditions and confusions,"]],[340,["we started seeking more and more,"]],[343,["and the real seeking is that of beyond."]],[347,["Of course we must say"]],[350,["that the play of the seeking is not only human."]],[354,["There is also God’s play."]],[356,["It is God who wants you to seek."]],[359,["It is God who wants you to get your realization."]],[363,["You are the epitome of his creation."]],[366,["Human beings are the height that he has created."]],[368,["Do you see how beautifully He has created"]],[370,["in thousands of years from amoeba, from carbon,"]],[374,["say, from a hydrogen atom you have become like this?"]],[378,["There must be some purpose, some reason"]],[381,["why God has made you like this."]],[384,["It’s not just a wasteful, purposeless activity of God."]],[389,["But what is the purpose of God? Why did he do it?"]],[392,["Nobody thinks about it."]],[393,["Scientists, of course, they being honest,"]],[395,["they say we cannot find out so forget about it."]],[398,["Whatever they cannot find out and reason out they just don’t discuss."]],[402,["So one has to see"]],[404,["whether there is some reason or not,"]],[407,["or is there any purpose in our life,"]],[409,["or are we to come on this Earth and just to die"]],[412,["like any other animal"]],[414,["and have no gains in our human awareness?"]],[420,["This question has been arising into the minds of thousands of people"]],[426,["and at this time as you know the market was full with the idea"]],[430,["that we have to seek."]],[432,["So the market got flooded"]],[434,["with all kinds of people who wanted to market it."]],[437,["I mean, it's automatic."]],[440,["There are marketeers for everything."]],[443,["You want something? You will find marketeers just coming around"]],[446,["and that’s how it happened"]],[448,["and they took advantage of the simplicity"]],[452,["and of the naîvity of the people and they misused them"]],[458,["and misled them."]],[460,["They could not understand"]],[462,["how God can be organized by these people,"]],[467,["whether they were the contractors of God"]],[469,["or how could they talk of God,"]],[471,["what was the sign and symptom of a person"]],[475,["who comes to you and says that I am God"]],[477,["and you should receive these things from me."]],[482,["What we believe in was superficial"]],[488,["superficial appearances."]],[490,["Like a person has 58 Rolls Royces."]],[493,["He must be a great man, not a saint."]],[497,["The saint doesn’t have any Rolls Royces."]],[500,["We could not see that."]],[501,["For us it was very much great that he lives in a big mansion."]],[506,["Not the saint."]],[507,["The Saint doesn’t want mansions. He can live on the street."]],[510,["For him it does not matter whether it’s a mansion or a street,"]],[513,["makes no difference to him."]],[514,["This is the simple thing that they did not know about a saint"]],[519,["and they got impressed by all these things,"]],[521,["by media and the way they put up the show and circus that they can."]],[526,["This is the sadest part of the whole story"]],[529,["and that’s how our seeking was misled."]],[533,["Today I would like to say about this chakra especially"]],[537,["that is what we call the “Nabhi Chakra,”"]],[540,["is the central path of our evolution"]],[543,["where you start your seeking"]],[545,["and you crossover to the other side."]],[548,["Now surrounding this you will find there is"]],[552,["the ocean of illusion"]],[556,["and this ocean of illusion was governed by a deity,"]],[563,["by a special powerful personality"]],[568,["whom we call as “Dattatreya,” is the Primordial Master"]],[572,["and he incarnated on this Earth many a times."]],[575,["At the time of Christ, and even before that,"]],[578,["he incarnated as, say, Abraham, Moses, Socrates, Lao Tze."]],[584,["Later on he incarnated as Mohammad Sahab,"]],[587,["then the same great principle incarnated as Nanaka,"]],[591,["then the same principle at the last incarnated as"]],[595,["Sainath of Shirdi."]],[598,["So the same great principle"]],[602,["of this Primordial Master has incarnated"]],[606,["because without a master,"]],[608,["how will you be taken away from this illusion?"]],[612,["How we are you going to be exposed"]],[615,["to that reality which you do not feel?"]],[619,["What has to happen to you"]],[622,["is that you have to become more sensitive,"]],[625,["more open, awakened and enlightened"]],[628,["to feel that all-pervading power around you."]],[633,["These masters came again and again and told you,"]],[636,["that you must look after your “Dharma.”"]],[639,["Dharma doesn’t mean any religion"]],[641,["that is being established in the names of these people."]],[643,["Because human beings know how to make a pickle out of everyone."]],[647,["They are great experts."]],[648,["All of them in essence are one and the same."]],[652,["But like flowers on the same tree can be taken away"]],[656,["from time to time and when they become ugly"]],[659,["and they become completely spoilt"]],[661,["then people can claim this is my flower, this is my flower."]],[664,["Everybody has become a contractor of this thing."]],[668,["Actually these people belong to the whole universe,"]],[671,["they are universal beings and they came on this earth"]],[674,["to give us a sustenance within us."]],[677,["Sustenance, Dharma means a sustenance,"]],[679,["this quality that is human."]],[684,["For example, gold has a quality"]],[688,["that it is untarnishable."]],[690,["Carbon has a quality that it is tetravalent."]],[693,["In the same way, human beings have ten valencies"]],[697,["or, we can say, they have a quality of having these ten"]],[704,["specialities in them so that they can be called as human beings."]],[708,["All these ten specialities are represented"]],[711,["by the ten incarnations of this Primordial Spirit on this Earth."]],[716,["There are many other Spirits who came"]],[719,["who are followers or, we can say, the disciples"]],[724,["incarnations of this great power"]],[727,["which we call as the Primordial Master."]],[730,["And such a Primordial Master is needed no doubt"]],[732,["but such a Primordial Master has to have certain qualities."]],[736,["If they are missing, how is he going to be our master?"]],[741,["A guru means a person"]],[744,["who has got that weight in him,"]],[747,["weight of virtues, of qualities, of righteousness, of holiness."]],[752,["A person who is not righteous, who is a parasite,"]],[755,["who leads a bad life cannot be your guru."]],[759,["Not only that but what is a guru’s speciality is"]],[763,["that he makes you meet God,"]],[766,["he connects you to God."]],[767,["He doesn’t connect you to all kinds of funny things"]],[770,["that these gurus are doing nowadays."]],[773,["On this point I have to tell you how the false people work it out"]],[778,["and how the reality works out."]],[781,["Now if you see on the right hand side of this lies"]],[787,["the power of your kriya shakti, as your “action power.”"]],[793,["Now what they do is they tell you"]],[795,["that you start doing some sort of a jumping,"]],[798,["standing on your head or they may say"]],[800,["that take out your tongue."]],[802,["There was a guru here, now he doesn’t do that,"]],[804,["he is dead – but what he did in his lifetime,"]],[807,["he asked people to cut the tongue"]],[810,["at the base and put the tongue back"]],[812,["and do some sort of a trick,"]],[814,["I don’t know what he called it, a... “khechari.”"]],[818,["All these nonsensical things people started doing,"]],[821,["to push your eyes down like that,"]],[823,["or to stand on your head,"]],[826,["stand on one leg and do all kinds of these tricks."]],[832,["You cannot go to God."]],[834,["This is not the way to be done."]],[836,["This is not the way you can get to God."]],[838,["It’s sahaja, It’s spontaneous."]],[840,["It’s a process that is living."]],[842,["It cannot work out by these tricks"]],[845,["that people tell you - do this, do that."]],[847,["This is not the way it is going to work out. Remember!"]],[850,["It will only work out"]],[851,["if there is a spontaneous happening of Kundalini awakening"]],[856,["which is the Holy Mother you have got."]],[858,["She is an auspicious Mother, She is the Holy Mother."]],[861,["She is not unholy and you cannot use it for any unholy purpose."]],[866,["Now we have lost the meaning of the word holy."]],[868,["We have lost the meaning of the word auspiciousness."]],[874,["We do not know what righteousness is."]],[876,["In these modern times these words sound so hollow and so funny."]],[879,["But you will be amazed that this exists within us"]],[884,["whether you like it or not."]],[886,["If we do not get the blessings of holiness,"]],[891,["you cannot raise the Kundalini."]],[894,["Kundalini is a spontaneous thing,"]],[897,["is just like a seed that sprouts in the Mother Earth."]],[901,["In the same way when the warmth of holiness"]],[904,["and auspiciousness is faced by a person,"]],[908,["then only the Kundalini is going to rise."]],[911,["So any guru who comes and tells you"]],[912,["that I give you a realization, you stand on your head, You tell him,"]],[915,["“You better go on stand untill you get your realization.”"]],[919,["Then there are many other things they’ll tell you."]],[920,["They say that you will start flying."]],[923,["Now we have to understand all these nonsensical things,"]],[927,["why do we want to do? Why do we want to fly in the air?"]],[930,["You are already flying a bit too much."]],[932,["Just now I was coming in the sky, I saw so many aeroplanes"]],[935,["that I thought a day may come"]],[937,["when you will have to find some sort of a method"]],[940,["of arranging the crossing of these aeroplanes"]],[944,["and how the traffic has to be arranged even there."]],[948,["Now all such ideas that we are going to fly"]],[951,["or somebody says that we become sort of"]],[954,["a person who leaves the body and goes up"]],[957,["and sees from there."]],[959,["Or somebody who sees the colors or who sees the auras."]],[963,["All these things seeing you can do otherwise."]],[968,["It is not a seeing"]],[970,["that is important. As I told you yesterday,"]],[972,["saying that this is the Truth – there are many who say this is the Truth."]],[978,["You have to become the Truth."]],[980,["There is a second thing you have to know today"]],[982,["that by seeing something you do not become."]],[985,["If you see something – suppose if you are coming by this road."]],[989,["We saw this church."]],[992,["But when we came in we don’t see it now."]],[996,["When you are away from it, when we crossed the mountain,"]],[1000,["we never saw it."]],[1002,["When we are honest, we never saw it."]],[1004,["When we were away from it then we saw it."]],[1007,["So seeing something is not receiving that,"]],[1011,["is not to be."]],[1013,["To be means in your awareness, as I said"]],[1015,["in your central nervous system you must feel"]],[1019,["that you have become the Spirit."]],[1022,["Yesterday I told you about the Spirit"]],[1024,["and what are the blessings of the Spirit and how you get it."]],[1027,["But if your dharma is not all right –"]],[1030,["supposing you have moved too much to the right side."]],[1032,["Even a person who is a very busy man,"]],[1035,["he is running the rat race, he has no time for God,"]],[1038,["he has no time for his Spirit, nothing, he is running very fast."]],[1041,["Alright, you run fast and jump into the place where you have to go."]],[1048,["You have to be in the center."]],[1051,["Not extreme action"]],[1055,["can take you to your real path."]],[1058,["If you take a car for example – In your practical life"]],[1063,["you always try to keep everything in the center"]],[1065,["in the sense your car cannot run on one-sided wheels."]],[1068,["It has to have both the wheels."]],[1070,["On a chair you cannot sit if it has only two legs,"]],[1074,["on one side you cannot sit."]],[1076,["Our center of gravity acts in the center."]],[1080,["In our normal life we keep to the center."]],[1084,["We cannot walk with one side like this."]],[1087,["We have to put both the legs on the ground"]],[1089,["and walk on both the legs."]],[1091,["In the same way if you try to act on one side,"]],[1095,["as I told you yesterday you can create a terrible imbalance."]],[1098,["Especially in dharma it happens"]],[1100,["and that’s why I am telling you today"]],[1102,["that any extreme behavior on dharma is not needed."]],[1107,["There is no need to go on madly calling, “God, oh God, come along,“"]],[1111,["people are saying mantras now."]],[1113,["Any sort of mantra they take."]],[1115,["There is one guru who charges three hundred pounds"]],[1118,["and the mantra he gives means -"]],[1121,["in Hindi word called as “thinga.”"]],[1123,["When you show like this [Shri Mataji shows her right-hand thumb] that is it."]],[1126,["So many people are doing it, paying 300 pounds."]],[1130,["You tell any Indian and he will just laugh."]],[1133,["How can it be?  “Inga”,"]],[1134,["“Inga” in Marathi language means the tail of a scorpion."]],[1139,["These are the mantras they are giving to you,"]],[1141,["and you are paying three hundred pounds for that."]],[1143,["Now the mantra cannot be given like that."]],[1147,["It’s a wrong idea that you give some mantra to somebody."]],[1151,["For example, every center has a different mantra."]],[1155,["Every center has got a problem,"]],[1158,["when the Kundalini rises you know."]],[1161,["When you come, say, to the center of Shri Krishna,"]],[1166,["now you have to take the name of Shri Krishna."]],[1168,["If you come to the center of the gurus, of the Adiguru,"]],[1172,["of the sat gurus, then you have to take the names of satgurus."]],[1177,["Satguru means the one who is the real master."]],[1182,["Then you have to take their names."]],[1183,["But if you are taking the name of some one person..."]],[1188,["for example say we take the name of Rama."]],[1191,["Now where is the center of Rama? You can see there."]],[1194,["The center of Rama is on the right side of the Heart center."]],[1200,["Now if you take the name of Rama and you have no problems,"]],[1202,["you will get into problems."]],[1205,["It’s easy to get into the problems"]],[1207,["because Shri Rama is a deity."]],[1211,["You cannot just take his name without any protocol."]],[1214,["There is no rhyme and reason. For example,"]],[1217,["if I take the name of, say, the Governor of this place"]],[1220,["and just go before his house and start shouting his name,"]],[1224,["they will arrest me."]],[1226,["In the same way if you take the name of Rama"]],[1228,["without having any protocol, without having any understanding,"]],[1233,["first of all, this center will be ruined [pointing towards her throat]"]],[1236,["because you will be taking the names,"]],[1238,["means you will be using your voice all the time unnecessarily"]],[1242,["and also the right side Heart Center will be caught."]],[1245,["And all such people will suffer physically from asthma."]],[1252,["Absolutely."]],[1253,["If you have asthma trouble"]],[1255,["then you can find out that you are suffering from this Rama center."]],[1260,["Maybe there is something wrong with your father,"]],[1262,["or maybe something wrong with your fatherhood,"]],[1264,["or maybe that you are missing your father,"]],[1268,["or that your father has died,"]],[1271,["or something is wrong with that."]],[1273,["Asthma can be cured only by taking Rama’s name."]],[1277,["But if you have asthma"]],[1278,["then the name has to be taken by a realized soul."]],[1283,["By a person who is empowered,"]],[1286,["who has the protocol,"]],[1288,["who can talk to Shri Rama in the sense who is connected."]],[1292,["Any Dick, Tom and Harry cannot take his name."]],[1295,["There is a protocol about it."]],[1297,["In the same way gurus names also"]],[1301,["we cannot take without protocol. We must have the protocol."]],[1305,["Anybody who is all the time saying guru, guru, guru, guru"]],[1308,["is not paying full attention to it, neither is he respecting."]],[1312,["I have seen people who go against the teachings of a guru."]],[1316,["For example, we can say that all the gurus have taught one thing,"]],[1321,["that you have to look after your awareness."]],[1324,["Awareness is in that area, awareness is nourished by liver."]],[1329,["They are very anxious that your liver should be alright."]],[1332,["Whatever they have taught,"]],[1334,["they have tried to see that your liver should be all right"]],[1336,["and all the gurus have been against alcoholism."]],[1340,["You take Moses, you take Abraham,"]],[1342,["you take Nanaka, you take Mohammad Sahab,"]],[1345,["all of them are more worried about the liver than for anything else."]],[1351,["Somebody asked me, “Why didn’t Christ decry wine?”"]],[1354,["He did not support it either,"]],[1356,["but he had some other job to be done, so he didn’t talk about it."]],[1360,["But he never drank wine."]],[1362,["The wine in those days didn’t mean fermented wine as you have."]],[1365,["I mean, people never used to smoke also in those days."]],[1368,["At the time of, say, Mohammad Sahab there was no smoking,"]],[1372,["so he never prohibited any smoking."]],[1374,["But he said no narcotics,"]],[1376,["nothing that goes against awareness should be taken."]],[1379,["So they said, “Oh, then there is nothing wrong with smoking.”"]],[1382,["Then he took his birth,"]],[1383,["the same principle took his birth as Guru Nanaka"]],[1386,["and Guru Nanaka then said no smoking and no drinking."]],[1391,["Why? Because they were worried about the awareness of a person."]],[1394,["If your awareness is not all right"]],[1397,["what’s the use of giving you your realization?"]],[1398,["You are already not aware of it."]],[1402,["Now drugs, same thing."]],[1404,["If you take to drugs or anything like that,"]],[1407,["you go down in your awareness. It's a fact."]],[1411,["If you take some drugs you may go to the right side"]],[1417,["and you might see colors and things. But that’s hallucination."]],[1420,["You go to the other side you may feel,"]],[1422,["oh, you are dying and you may go into the subconscious"]],[1425,["and then to the collective subconscious."]],[1427,["You may go to the collective supraconscious on the right-hand side."]],[1430,["But to go up you have to keep in the center."]],[1432,["You have to be alert and your awareness should be normal."]],[1436,["To keep it normal, to keep it in balance,"]],[1439,["these people prescribe"]],[1441,["that you should not try to do anything that is too much."]],[1447,["Extremes should be avoided."]],[1450,["But the result of that was just the opposite."]],[1453,["All the fanatics were born out of these teachings, imagine!"]],[1458,["All the fanatics were born out of these teachings,"]],[1461,["which were meant not to have any fanaticism."]],[1465,["Actually if somebody is a fanatic,"]],[1468,["he develops diseases of the stomach."]],[1470,["Fanaticism gives you horrible diseases of the stomach."]],[1474,["The other day we had a gentleman from Iran."]],[1478,["He is a doctor there and he had cancer."]],[1480,["He came to know about me and he came to see me in London."]],[1484,["And I told him that,"]],[1486,["“Do you believe that Mohammad Sahab is the only one"]],[1490,["who can save the world?” He said yes."]],[1491,["“Then I think He should have saved it.”"]],[1494,["\"No but I think He is the only one who can save, He was the last.\""]],[1497,["I said, “Maybe He might have thought, that 'I am the last',"]],[1500,["but He must have been, the way you are behaving,"]],[1503,["he must have taken his birth again.”"]],[1504,["He could not keep it at that state perhaps."]],[1507,["I said, “Can you believe that he came back as Guru Nanak?”"]],[1510,["He said, “I can’t believe it, no I can't believe it.”"]],[1513,["I said, “He was the same principle.”"]],[1515,["“I can’t believe it.” I said, “Then I can’t help you."]],[1517,["If you are a fanatic, I can’t help you. It cannot be cured.”"]],[1521,["Now, he went home and he had terrible time"]],[1523,["and his wife was wise enough, she said,"]],[1525,["“Now, Islam has not helped you so far,"]],[1528,["You have been such a big Muslim,"]],[1529,["you have been doing Namaz and all that."]],[1531,["Still your cancer cannot be cured."]],[1532,["So why not listen to Mother. If she says so give up.”"]],[1535,["So he came down to me and he said, “All right,"]],[1538,["I agree that it was Nanaka"]],[1540,["who came on this earth and all that.”"]],[1542,["and you will be amazed that he is cured."]],[1544,["He is cured of that trouble."]],[1547,["All these fundamentalist and fanatics, we are aware of it."]],[1551,["Americans had a good look at them recently,"]],[1555,["very recently they had a nice shock from a man called Mr. Khomeini."]],[1560,["You know him too well."]],[1561,["But if you go and ask him he’ll say, “Oh, I am just from God."]],[1565,["I am connected with God and it is He"]],[1567,["who gave me these orders and it is through His orders I worked out.”"]],[1571,["Because they are so blind with the fanaticism"]],[1574,["that they don’t want to see."]],[1575,["And this kind of fanaticism, if it crawls into you,"]],[1579,["you will also not see."]],[1580,["For example even Christian fundamentalists are the same"]],[1584,["or the Hindu fundamentalist are the same."]],[1585,["I don’t find anything different in them."]],[1589,["If you want to ask, say, a Christian about a Jew,"]],[1595,["you will know about the Jews, but if you go to the Jews,"]],[1597,["they’ll say Christians are the worst of all"]],[1600,["and if you go to the Muslims, they will say"]],[1602,["the Jews they are the worst, they are the cursed people."]],[1606,["All of them think they are the best, the chosen ones"]],[1609,["and the rest of them are going to be doomed."]],[1611,["I must tell you that all fanatics are going to be doomed."]],[1614,["One and all and I think in that domain of hell"]],[1619,["they may agree with each other but it may be too late"]],[1622,["for them to understand"]],[1623,["that God has not created as any fanatics."]],[1627,["He has not."]],[1629,["You are part and parcel of one being."]],[1631,["Supposing this finger says I am all right"]],[1633,["or this finger says I am all right,"]],[1636,["it is going to trouble the whole body."]],[1638,["It’s such a nonsense that it is better"]],[1640,["to cut it out than to keep it there."]],[1642,["Malignancy that works in us is the same that you are your own."]],[1647,["“What’s wrong? I am on my own.”"]],[1650,["Any cell that becomes like that is really malignant"]],[1653,["because it has no relationship with the whole."]],[1655,["It has no relationship with the coordination"]],[1658,["and the cooperation of the whole thing, how it is working out."]],[1661,["It is on its own. “What’s wrong?”"]],[1664,["The wrong is that you are getting out of circulation"]],[1670,["and very soon you will land up in a place which is called as hell."]],[1674,["And then you will ask,  “Oh, I never knew.\""]],[1679,["You are all connected with each other."]],[1681,["You are all part and parcel of one collective being"]],[1685,["which you have to just feel it and understand that you become that."]],[1689,["Till this [microphone] is connected to the mains this doesn’t work out."]],[1694,["Once it is connected to the mains it works out."]],[1697,["In the same way unless and until you are connected to the mains"]],[1700,["you cannot know that you are a collective being."]],[1705,["Before that, we form big organizations,"]],[1708,["we are all brothers and sisters and"]],[1711,["just after a month of that formation of an organisation you find"]],[1717,["that people are cutting each other’s throats."]],[1719,["Why? Because they are not really brothers and sisters."]],[1722,["They have not felt it."]],[1725,["When you become then you just can’t help it."]],[1729,["Like people may say that, Mother, you help so many people,"]],[1733,["you do so much for them. Why do you cure them?"]],[1735,["I said, “Whom do I cure? Who is the other?"]],[1738,["If this finger is paining I have to rub it off and get it all right."]],[1741,["It is part and parcel of me."]],[1743,["If there is not the other then you just help the other person"]],[1747,["because he is part and parcel of you."]],[1749,["If somebody is getting drowned and you are trying to save that person,"]],[1753,["hzyou are doing it because something in you is right."]],[1756,["You are not doing it because you are trying to help the person."]],[1759,["Because there is something in you is dying"]],[1761,["and you want to save that person."]],[1762,["This is what it is and this collectivity"]],[1765,["you can only feel if you are first of all in balance."]],[1770,["The people who go off their balances"]],[1773,["are very difficult to get their realization."]],[1775,["This is one side of the movement in dharma also when they seek God,"]],[1780,["when they seek their realization, they go to the other side of it."]],[1785,["Now people can’t believe that for this you cannot put in any effort."]],[1789,["No action is needed."]],[1791,["Now look at the trees. Look at the flowers."]],[1795,["How spontaneously they become fruits."]],[1799,["Look at the trees, how they turn the leaves towards the sun,"]],[1804,["and how they get their chlorophyll established in them,"]],[1808,["how it happens so spontaneously, how it works out,"]],[1812,["how they understand."]],[1813,["While we think that by doing some sort of an effort"]],[1817,["we are going to become something higher,"]],[1820,["is an absolutely absurd idea."]],[1823,["As it is you did nothing to become human beings."]],[1826,["You did nothing whatsoever."]],[1828,["You became a human being effortlessly"]],[1831,["and if you have to go further it has to be effortless."]],[1835,["Everything vital is always effortless."]],[1838,["As I said the other day, If you have to breathe"]],[1841,["and for breathing if you have to go to libraries and"]],[1844,["go to some guru and pay him some money,"]],[1846,["how many will survive?"]],[1849,["It is so vital that it has to happen."]],[1852,["The only difference in this evolution"]],[1854,["and the evolutions so far we have had is this,"]],[1857,["that this you being free,"]],[1861,["you are going to feel it in your awareness."]],[1865,["Before this you never felt it in your awareness."]],[1869,["Only at this time you are going to feel it in your awareness,"]],[1873,["that you have become the other person,"]],[1876,["that a cocoon has become the butterfly,"]],[1881,["that an egg has become a bird."]],[1885,["You can feel it within yourself this happening,"]],[1889,["you can absolutely"]],[1894,["monitor it within yourself and you are aware of it"]],[1898,["that this has happened to me."]],[1900,["This is a blessing placed within you since long"]],[1905,["and that’s why it is sahaja, means born with you, sahaja."]],[1909,["But today this Sahaja Yoga has become a maha yoga,"]],[1912,["it has become a great yoga"]],[1914,["because one can work it out en mass."]],[1918,["For many people can get realization."]],[1920,["Just like a blossom time, many, many flowers can become fruits."]],[1924,["In the same way many people can get realization."]],[1927,["At this time when it is such an important time,"]],[1930,["this is the time of judgement that has started."]],[1933,["How will you judge yourself?"]],[1936,["How will God judge you? Is He going to put you on, say,"]],[1941,["some sort of a weight lifting"]],[1944,["or to one of the human tricks that we play"]],[1948,["to judge a person’s abilities?"]],[1950,["No, the Kundalini is going to rise, first of all."]],[1955,["When the Kundalini rises"]],[1956,["you start getting that awareness on your fingers,"]],[1960,["you start feeling the all pervading power on your fingers"]],[1963,["because these are the centers of your subtle being"]],[1968,["which get awakened. You start feeling it."]],[1970,["And by that feeling you get that vibratory awareness"]],[1973,["by which you get the discrimination"]],[1975,["and you know what’s wrong with you"]],[1977,["and you know what’s wrong with others."]],[1979,["So you judge yourself, you improve yourself,"]],[1982,["you know the method how to improve yourself,"]],[1984,["you feel better and better and better"]],[1986,["and then once you are all right you judge yourself."]],[1989,["There is no need for God to judge"]],[1991,["but God within you, your own Spirit, judges you."]],[1995,["Because when the Kundalini rises She touches the fontanel bone area"]],[2000,["where She pierces through you."]],[2001,["You can feel first sometimes the throbbing"]],[2004,["and then the cool breeze starts coming in."]],[2007,["There is the Spirit. The seat of the Spirit,"]],[2011,["though he resides in the Heart of the human beings,"]],[2013,["the seat of the Spirit is on top of your head"]],[2017,["and when it touches that you start getting this discrimination"]],[2020,["and you start understanding."]],[2022,["Now if I tell you don’t do this,"]],[2024,["that’s why these ten commandments are"]],[2027,["that don’t do this, don’t do that."]],[2030,["But human beings are such"]],[2031,["if you tell them don’t do it, they’ll do it, a hundred times."]],[2036,["There’s something wrong with them, I tell you,"]],[2038,["the brain is sometimes upside down, I think."]],[2040,["If you tell them please don’t do it, even if you tell to a child,"]],[2045,["don’t put your hand in the candle, still he will burn it."]],[2049,["He is so ego oriented that he must learn by burning his hand."]],[2054,["He must learn everything through experience of his ego."]],[2057,["Till he is nicely bashed he won’t listen."]],[2061,["So the best thing I thought was to give the realization."]],[2065,["Once you have the realization,"]],[2067,["once your car has started, you will know where is the problem."]],[2070,["Because if you tell somebody this is the problem"]],[2073,["he may hit you back."]],[2074,["It's not easy. If you tell somebody,”You have too much ego,”"]],[2077,["he will come and box you completely."]],[2079,["You can be crucified. I mean, this is what has happened to Christ."]],[2082,["It is not easy to deal with human beings. They are so much-"]],[2085,["just like a big snake sitting down there."]],[2088,["You tell them something and it just comes on you."]],[2090,["Because if you mesmerize them,"]],[2092,["if you pamper their ego, “Oh you are great people,"]],[2095,["only pass on your money to me and you will be yogis,"]],[2098,["you will be siddhas,\" so you don’t mind, its all right, very simple."]],[2101,["You give some money to Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[2103,["“All right. She has all the money. Doesn’t matter."]],[2105,["We have the siddhas, we are the siddhas.”"]],[2108,["We are the great yogis, My name is Fallana Anand,"]],[2112,["Thikana Anand, Dhonga Anand.” All these names you will wear."]],[2116,["Then clothes you will wear and walk with a great pride,"]],[2118,["“Oh, we are the yogis.”"]],[2121,["Absolutely stupid."]],[2123,["You are not, you  are not."]],[2126,["But you believe in it, because there is nothing involved,"]],[2129,["you don’t have to grow, nothing, very simple."]],[2132,["It is not so."]],[2134,["You are seekers"]],[2136,["and you will be seekers till you have found it."]],[2139,["Its better that you find it and accept it."]],[2142,["Because I said don’t do it,"]],[2144,["don’t go there, you are doing it. All right."]],[2150,["So the mother's style is different, alright awaken their Kundalini."]],[2153,["First of all, awaken their Kundalini."]],[2155,["We had one doctor, Rustom Veera"]],[2157,["and he is a very good doctor who got his realization."]],[2162,["After that I told him that now you won’t drink"]],[2165,["and he really forgot about drinking completely,"]],[2167,["I never told him before."]],[2169,["“You drink? All right, come along, doesn’t matter.\""]],[2170,["Whatever you do, come along."]],[2172,["He said, “Mother, I never felt like drinking.”"]],[2174,["But once after some time he went to Germany"]],[2178,["and he told me that he used to like some sort of a wine"]],[2181,["and he said that now let us see what happens."]],[2184,["Because he was very fond of it,"]],[2186,["so he went to drink that"]],[2188,["and he got a terrible pain in the stomach, he vomited out,"]],[2191,["and the whole thing was smelling like a rotten cork"]],[2196,["and he said, “As if a cork was coming out of my mouth,"]],[2198,["I felt so horrible and after that I said I’ve had it.”"]],[2202,["And his health improved and his money improved"]],[2205,["because he was not wasting any more money on these nonsensical things."]],[2208,["He had nice musical gadgets in his house"]],[2211,["and he started improving his life in every way."]],[2214,["He started looking so beautiful and so nice."]],[2216,["Now the thing is if I tell you don’t drink,"]],[2219,["I tell you, all the pub people will come and hit me hard."]],[2222,["But I don’t say that. It just works out"]],[2224,["because once you have found out the nectar,"]],[2227,["the beauty of yourself, you do not do it."]],[2231,["You drink because you are bored,"]],[2233,["you smoke because you are bored of yourself."]],[2235,["You just get bored. If you are imprisoned,"]],[2238,["why should you be so unhappy? You are just facing yourself."]],[2241,["It’s the best thing that can happen to the person is to be imprisoned."]],[2244,["See you are just watching yourself"]],[2246,["and Self is the most beautiful thing."]],[2248,["But people are unhappy because they cannot face themselves."]],[2252,["They want to run away. For five minutes also people won’t"]],[2255,["sit down together and talk to each other."]],[2257,["They must call you for a cocktail"]],[2259,["or there should be a television going on"]],[2261,["or there should be some book two people must be reading."]],[2263,["They cannot talk for five minutes. There’s no rapport."]],[2267,["But after realization you feel so relaxed"]],[2273,["and so happy with yourself. You enjoy yourself so much"]],[2276,["that you forget about these things. Now we have people here,"]],[2278,["some of them have been druggists and chemists completely,"]],[2282,["alcoholics and all sorts of things"]],[2284,["and just it has worked out so well"]],[2287,["that they have now become people who are so beautiful."]],[2291,["They have got this nectar of their Spirit and they are giving it."]],[2296,["The imbalances on the left-hand side,"]],[2299,["because yesterday I told you about"]],[2301,["the physical side and the emotional side,"]],[2304,["but today I am telling you about the religious side, what we do."]],[2308,["That we believe in going to spirits,"]],[2311,["all the spirits, to the planchettes and this and that."]],[2314,["I was told that in Los Angeles you have got witchcraft,"]],[2319,["you have all types of nonsensical things going on."]],[2322,["And for what do you do it?"]],[2324,["They said that you see my father died"]],[2326,["and I loved him very much and wanted to meet him."]],[2329,["Now “Let him die. Poor thing has died now, is spared of you."]],[2334,["Let him have his freedom. Why are you torturing his soul?”"]],[2338,["“Oh, I wanted to talk to him,” and then what you get is asthma."]],[2344,["As a result of that your father suffers because he must die now,"]],[2348,["he has to be in another world and you have to face it"]],[2351,["because now you are living. You are in the present."]],[2353,["Why do you want to call people who have now gone and finished?"]],[2357,["But once you start doing all these things then mesmerism starts,"]],[2360,["the ESP starts, all this nonsense starts"]],[2363,["and you become slaves to this"]],[2364,["and these things can be so dangerous."]],[2366,["English language is such a funny language"]],[2369,["that you have got for spirit"]],[2370,["even if you have to say the alcohol is spirit"]],[2373,["even the spirit that is dead is a spirit"]],[2376,["and your Spirit that is in your Heart"]],[2378,["which is the Atma is also Spirit and the Holy Ghost is also a Spirit."]],[2383,["So I don’t know which spirit you are worshipping."]],[2387,["I am talking of the Spirit that is the Atma,"]],[2390,["the Spirit within your Heart."]],[2392,["And we go to all kinds of these spirits morning till evening,"]],[2395,["going towards the left side."]],[2397,["Now you will be amazed the result of this physically is –"]],[2401,["physically, leave alone other things –"]],[2405,["multiple sclerosis is one of them."]],[2409,["Recently I cured a patient of multiple sclerosis."]],[2412,["He has been to one of these gurus"]],[2414,["who is very popular in this country."]],[2418,["He has got multiple sclerosis now."]],[2420,["Another thing that you get is blood cancer."]],[2425,["Most of the cancers come from that side"]],[2428,["and all these things can happen to you"]],[2431,["if you indulge into the left side."]],[2433,["Now it has been proved by doctors also"]],[2436,["that there are some sort of proteins which attack us"]],[2439,["from the area which is unknown,"]],[2441,["which is built within us since our creation, means our left side,"]],[2445,["the collective conscious side."]],[2447,["It has been accepted"]],[2448,["but, of course, they call it unknown because they are not seers,"]],[2451,["they are not people who have reached that stage to see"]],[2454,["that these spirits are coming from the left side."]],[2456,["I actually see them do it and attacking them"]],[2460,["and getting out of them and they are there within us."]],[2463,["Any time they can erupt"]],[2465,["and trigger anything like cancer on the physical level."]],[2468,["Then you can develop epilepsy,"]],[2470,["you can develop schizophrenia,"]],[2472,["you can develop all kinds of these mental problems, lunacy."]],[2475,["All these problems comes to you from the left side."]],[2478,["From the right side movement you can become extremely arrogant."]],[2482,["You can become absolutely useless for any talking or discussion."]],[2487,["You lack all the sense of proportion and you can become even Hitler."]],[2492,["Hitler is one of the symbols of this development of right side."]],[2496,["Those who push you into your egos"]],[2500,["and pamper you too much, be very careful about them."]],[2502,["Be very careful, because they are pushing you into the right,"]],[2506,["in your dharma also, in your ascent, in your seeking,"]],[2511,["and the ones which are giving you on the left-hand side"]],[2513,["are also doing the same."]],[2515,["Now the simple thing is that people who are money-minded themselves"]],[2518,["they have a problem. Always money-minded people"]],[2523,["are stuck up – I don’t know what to call them –"]],[2528,["they are absolutely stuck up people"]],[2530,["because money-mindedness comes to us"]],[2533,["because we value money more than anything else."]],[2536,["Money is not the source of joy by any chance."]],[2539,["Even those who have lots of money, if you go and see them,"]],[2542,["they are the most miserable people."]],[2545,["On the contrary, a man who hasn’t got so much money,"]],[2548,["who has no problems, he is happy."]],[2551,["For example, supposing I own this machine."]],[2554,["Let's take a simple example -"]],[2557,["What happens to me – I am worried about it,"]],[2560,["about cleansing it, about its insurance, I don’t know what is"]],[2563,["the income tax, all these things come with it."]],[2565,["If I don’t own it, it is owned by, say, Mr.Hugo,"]],[2568,["the headache is gone."]],[2570,["To possess something means a headache."]],[2573,["Today I wanted to have some money cashed."]],[2577,["It was such an experience of such a developed country like yours"]],[2580,["and Los Angeles I was amazed."]],[2583,["We couldn’t get money anywhere."]],[2586,["We only needed two thousand dollars."]],[2592,["I had to pay cash money to people"]],[2597,["and they said we don’t have so much money."]],[2599,["They told us to go to the main bank"]],[2601,["and it was as if we went to the mint."]],[2603,["From 9:30 till about one o’clock we couldn’t get the money."]],[2607,["They made me sign this, sign that, sign this."]],[2611,["I said, “What’s happening?"]],[2612,["You people are supposed to be affluent people. There is no trust,"]],[2615,["are people standing with a pistol somewhere?"]],[2617,["What is happening - I don’t understand."]],[2619,["When you have so much money. How could you have so much?”"]],[2622,["But in India no problem."]],[2625,["I was in a place called Nilambar."]],[2628,["I told Warren, “I am not going. You take my passport"]],[2632,["and give them this thing that I have signed.”"]],[2635,["Not only that, they sent money, they heard I was here,"]],[2638,["they all came from the bank to take my darshan"]],[2641,["and to get their realization."]],[2643,["People trust in poor countries, they just trust."]],[2646,["Here you come, you have to have visa and this thing."]],[2649,["In India if you come nobody will be bothered."]],[2652,["You have to trust. If riches means mistrust... ?"]],[2655,["In London people won’t open their houses."]],[2658,["Even a rat does not enter their house."]],[2661,["Morning till evening, the wives, poor things, are cleaning."]],[2666,["I’ve seen them cleaning all the knobs, everything,"]],[2670,["cleaning the garden, all these things."]],[2673,["I not even a rat enters their house."]],[2676,["They open the door only a very small gap."]],[2679,["I have not seen anybody enter their house."]],[2682,["Only the husband and wife come,"]],[2683,["all frightened, looking at each other,"]],[2686,["holding their purses like this."]],[2687,["It’s most surprising."]],[2689,["You are people belonging to a free country."]],[2693,["From where did you get these people around?"]],[2695,["In India there’s no question."]],[2697,["We walk with all our ornaments. Nobody does that to us."]],[2701,["One lady was killed when she was wearing lots of ornaments."]],[2706,["Early in the morning, she was going by a train"]],[2708,["all alone in first class, going for a wedding"]],[2711,["and some man killed her and took all the ornaments."]],[2713,["It was too much of a temptation."]],[2715,["And the place was that and the time was that."]],[2718,["Oh, God, there was the whole of the university"]],[2720,["went into strike for that."]],[2723,["Such a commotion had risen."]],[2725,["I said in London every third day there is a mugging going on."]],[2729,["This is nothing. In London it’s so common"]],[2731,["and now I am told that here you can’t get money even in the bank."]],[2736,["I have to go for three hours"]],[2738,["just to get an ordinary two thousand dollars."]],[2741,["Can you believe it? And is that the sign of freedom?"]],[2745,["Is that the sign of affluence?"]],[2748,["What is happening is that people are insecure,"]],[2752,["they are insecure completely"]],[2754,["because of this money mounting. They live with their money."]],[2757,["If there is no money what is the matter?"]],[2760,["It doesn't matter. It is not so important."]],[2764,["But the way people are after money all the time counting every pie,"]],[2768,["they lose this chance."]],[2770,["Their Vishuddhis go out but worst of all their Nabhi,"]],[2775,["the Nabhi Chakra goes out. You get a Left Nabhi problem."]],[2778,["Such people may get also blood cancers"]],[2780,["they may get troubles of the left Nabhi,"]],[2783,["and such people have such a terrific"]],[2787,["speediness and such franticness."]],[2793,["If they see money somewhere they go absolutely mad"]],[2796,["as if money is like a some sort of a spirit or ghost they have seen."]],[2801,["Any talk of money they just jump onto it. It’s too much."]],[2805,["I just can’t understand such personalities."]],[2807,["They are most abnormal, absurd people."]],[2809,["How are they human beings if money can rule you?"]],[2812,["Then you are slaves of money."]],[2815,["You talk of independence and freedom. Where is your freedom?"]],[2818,["The money is ruling you here."]],[2821,["That’s what happens in your seeking."]],[2823,["When you come to a money-minded person,"]],[2826,["he will say, “You can pay money to me"]],[2830,["and you can purchase God.” You feel very happy."]],[2833,["“Ah, very good idea. We can purchase God also.”"]],[2837,["Can you purchase God?"]],[2840,["That’s how these people take advantage of that ego."]],[2843,["You think that we have money and we can purchase God."]],[2849,["Christ has said that a rich man cannot enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[2856,["Even a camel can pass through the"]],[2862,["hole of a needle,"]],[2865,["but a rich man cannot enter into the Kingdom of God"]],[2869,["because he is stuck up."]],[2879,["He is completely entranced with this money thing."]],[2884,["Now when they start that this is all junk and this is all nonsense,"]],[2888,["we should get out of it."]],[2890,["So what do you do?"]],[2892,["You say give up these things, let us start another counter culture."]],[2897,["But you are not out of it."]],[2899,["Just it is a make believe. You are not out of it."]],[2902,["You think that you have done it but you have not done it."]],[2905,["How you will get out of it is only through your awakening"]],[2909,["of this center where there is a deity"]],[2911,["who is the Father,"]],[2914,["who is the preserver aspect of God,"]],[2918,["who exists in that area."]],[2920,["Unless and until you believe that there is a preserver"]],[2923,["who looks after us, the God Almighty looks after us,"]],[2928,["you are not going to get out of it."]],[2930,["After realization, supposing you are a poor person,"]],[2932,["If you have problems of money"]],[2934,["you will be surprised, your material side improves."]],[2937,["It improves so much."]],[2940,["But how? Krishna has said, “Yoga kshema vahamyaham.”"]],[2944,["When you get the yoga you get the well being."]],[2947,["When you get the union with God, then this is the center of Lakshmi,"]],[2952,["the center of the Goddess of wealth, of well being –"]],[2955,["if She is awakened in you, you get your money."]],[2958,["But the money is not the way Mr. Ford has got, no, not that money."]],[2961,["It is the Lakshmi."]],[2963,["Lakshmi is a very beautiful symbol of a balanced, moneyed man."]],[2967,["In Her one hand, first of all, She is a lady."]],[2971,["She is a lady standing on a lotus."]],[2973,["Can you imagine how light She must be."]],[2977,["Here if a rich man walks you see he must have a special honking thing."]],[2981,["If he sits here he must show that he is a very rich man."]],[2984,["He walks with a big gait"]],[2986,["and he must have a big car to show off that he is a very big man."]],[2990,["But here She just stands on a lotus."]],[2993,["She is so simple"]],[2998,["and She has four hands."]],[3000,["On two hands She has got the lotus."]],[3003,["Lotus means She has warmth, She has Love, the pink color,"]],[3007,["and inside the lotus is such a soft"]],[3013,["bed, a soft bed,"]],[3015,["and the bed is used by a very"]],[3021,["thorny insect whom we call as a beetle."]],[3026,["It’s a very thorny black thing that is used for sleeping."]],[3032,["So the person who has money has to be warm like a lotus"]],[3037,["and anybody who comes to his house he must be welcomed"]],[3040,["the way the lotus welcomes"]],[3042,["and puts him on this beautiful soft couch."]],[3047,["Even a person like a gnat, if he comes, She must offer."]],[3050,["This as a sign. Here if a guest comes in, had it."]],[3055,["And the guest, as soon as he sees the face of a person"]],[3058,["where he enters, he just runs away."]],[3060,["He can’t bear it because to them it means expense."]],[3063,["Any guest coming in, means expense."]],[3066,["But the amount of joy one can get in giving something to another"]],[3070,["is not there."]],[3071,["So generosity is the only way to overcome your greed for money."]],[3076,["If you earn money better give it. If you earn two, give three."]],[3080,["If you buy something, buy it for giving."]],[3083,["If you start doing like that you will get over this money-mindedness"]],[3088,["which is such a mire into which so many people have embedded."]],[3093,["Actually the poor are better,"]],[3095,["If you go to a poor man’s house he will offer you a lot of milk,"]],[3098,["he will be happy that you have come to his house."]],[3100,["Whatever things he has he will offer you."]],[3101,["But if you go to a rich man’s house he will be really frightened"]],[3105,["that one guest has come in his house"]],[3107,["when he can afford to look after thousands."]],[3109,["He cannot bear it. So generosity is the only solution for people"]],[3113,["who are money-minded."]],[3114,["On the contrary your generosity will flow to people"]],[3117,["who do not deserve it like these horrible gurus."]],[3121,["You see that they have got keeps, they have got big cars,"]],[3125,["they have built big mansions. They are parasites"]],[3128,["and you are flowing money on to them because your ego is there."]],[3132,["We have cults in India where they have competitions."]],[3137,["They take out the god’s photograph outside."]],[3140,["The one who is going to give 500 pounds,"]],[3144,["say for example, sits on the horse."]],[3147,["The one who gives 1000 pounds will sit on the elephant."]],[3152,["Like that they go on with the god"]],[3154,["and that’s how they go on in that community."]],[3157,["I have seen they also auction it."]],[3159,["“Now the one on the horse, how much, how much, how much, 500 pounds.”"]],[3164,["It’s like that, they are selling God and it’s a very regular thing."]],[3169,["You have to go and we call it calling,"]],[3172,["calling for that, how much money you are going to pay."]],[3175,["Is this the way to receive God and to understand him?"]],[3178,["This is all right for money-minded people."]],[3180,["They will go into the mire of money and finish there."]],[3183,["God is Love."]],[3185,["He is not money. He doesn’t understand money"]],[3190,["and godly people don’t. I am absolutely hopeless,"]],[3192,["I don’t understand this,"]],[3194,["I don’t know how to sign a check, I don’t know anything."]],[3196,["I only know Kundalini, but if you ask me about the money part"]],[3199,["I am so hopelessly bad that you will be amazed."]],[3202,["I am just like a rustic person"]],[3205,["who has never known ABCs of anything as far as money is concerned"]],[3209,["because I don’t understand why to worry about it so much."]],[3211,["What is the great need to count every time, to measure every time,"]],[3216,["to find out every time? There’s no need."]],[3219,["All that - such a headache, such a worry, such a problem."]],[3223,["Use whatever you get, you just live with it."]],[3226,["Why to worry about all these small things"]],[3228,["and to go about wasting your life for this nonsensical thing"]],[3232,["like material things. These we can create."]],[3235,["Just if you hit it in them it will all be created."]],[3238,["Human beings have already created."]],[3241,["What is so great about them?"]],[3243,["Now you have to take to the living course,"]],[3246,["the living power within you by which you create living work."]],[3250,["After realization you will be amazed."]],[3253,["If you give vibrations to the wheat or to any such things,"]],[3256,["to flowers, you get such big flowers."]],[3259,["We have tried this in an agricultural university"]],[3264,["and they have found out when you give vibrations to the wheat"]],[3267,["it can increase five times more in its growth."]],[3272,["They have seen an Indian cow,"]],[3274,["if she is given vibrated water to drink,"]],[3277,["she can give quite a lot of milk."]],[3278,["Not so much as we can say an Australian cow,"]],[3282,["but Australian cows milk is not a good thing."]],[3287,["Too much on the right hand side."]],[3288,["But she will give so much more than what she normally gives."]],[3292,["So you do not become too much. You become a Lakshmipati"]],[3296,["which means you get so much money that you can receive people,"]],[3299,["you can invite them, you are cosy"]],[3301,["and you live in a house which is beautiful."]],[3304,["She has another hand which is just giving."]],[3309,["If you earn you must give. Otherwise the whole thing stagnates."]],[3312,["I have known people who have gathered newspapers since 50 years."]],[3317,["They've got tubes of toothpaste gathered since they have been born."]],[3322,["All sorts of things we gather here"]],[3324,["thinking that - you see all kinds of mad people"]],[3327,["who go on collecting things"]],[3329,["and you have to actually get the municipal people"]],[3332,["to take it away after paying them big money"]],[3335,["to clear out this nonsense of the garbage"]],[3337,["these people have created in the house."]],[3340,["So this is how you should allow things to flow from your house."]],[3344,["Let it go, give it, give it and give it."]],[3347,["When you give then new things come in."]],[3349,["I have been giving only in my lifetime."]],[3352,["You will be amazed, I go on giving and giving and giving,"]],[3355,["but still my house and my everything is so filled"]],[3358,["I don’t know what to do. Every time I get a chance I give"]],[3364,["so that I do not hurt anybody and I give them."]],[3366,["But I find the whole house is filling up."]],[3369,["You give somebody one flower, they’ll send 10 flowers."]],[3371,["What to do? I can’t understand the people who preserve"]],[3375,["they’ll decay and become so old sitting down counting everything"]],[3380,["while I have seen this is the most healthy way of living in this world."]],[3384,["Just give, just give. Do not worry."]],[3387,["Anybody ask anything, likes to order? Have it."]],[3391,["It’s such a beautiful thing, such a great thing, such a joy."]],[3394,["Suddenly you meet somebody. The other day I met a lady in a party."]],[3397,["She said, “Do you remember? You gave me this?”"]],[3399,["I said, “Which one?” She said, “This one. I am wearing a pearl."]],[3403,["I had come to your house when I was married."]],[3404,["You gave me this pearl.” I said, “Really? I don’t remember.”"]],[3407,["“Oh, I wore it today just to show you.”"]],[3409,["I felt so happy."]],[3411,["Just what a little thing like pearl necklace I had given her."]],[3414,["But what a thing to remember all her life. She met me after 20 years."]],[3418,["That time she was pregnant and today she had a son."]],[3422,["I was so amazed to see this beautiful thing happening."]],[3425,["She wore it all the time, and she wore it the day she was to meet me."]],[3429,["She knew I was coming to the party. What a great feeling."]],[3433,["You cannot purchase it with thousands of these pearl necklaces"]],[3437,["can be thrown on this little beautiful event in my life"]],[3442,["that I felt this lady how she had cared for a little thing like that."]],[3446,["All these things are for expressing your love"]],[3451,["and if you understand the value of love, you can get rid of it."]],[3455,["Now the other hand of the Goddess is like this [Shri Mataji shows her right hand palm]."]],[3459,["This means a person who has money must give ashraya."]],[3463,["Ashraya means he must give a protection to people."]],[3468,["He must have some people who are in their protection."]],[3473,["Like in India people say that you have a servant system,"]],[3477,["but of course I do not say that in India servants are treated,"]],[3482,["I mean, my servant has a better bedroom than I have"]],[3488,["because my husband has one bedroom and actually I have a small one"]],[3491,["because I share his bedroom and he has a bigger one"]],[3494,["and he lives better than me in many ways"]],[3496,["but he is a person who can do all this work."]],[3499,["Now I have to do Kundalini work."]],[3500,["If I start sweeping and swabbing in the house,"]],[3502,["if my husband has to sweep and swab,"]],[3504,["whose going to look after his office?"]],[3506,["Here the thing is, even the president must go on and sweep and swab"]],[3509,["otherwise he is not all right. I don’t understand."]],[3512,["If you have people who are dependent upon you,"]],[3515,["I mean, your children should work for you."]],[3517,["In the same way there are servants."]],[3519,["If they work for you, what is wrong?"]],[3521,["In England I have seen old people die."]],[3524,["There is nobody to look after them."]],[3526,["One month they are lying in the rooms,"]],[3528,["there’s nobody to pick their bodies"]],[3530,["because they cannot have somebody to help."]],[3532,["And the young people are sitting outside and taking ganjas."]],[3536,["A shameful thing it is."]],[3539,["All their children might be taking ganja somewhere"]],[3541,["and their father is dying here."]],[3543,["Why can’t these people go and work"]],[3545,["and help their parents and look after them."]],[3548,["If they are old they are suppose to clean, sweep and swab."]],[3550,["Even the eighty year old people must drive their cars,"]],[3553,["they must take them to the thing. It’s not good."]],[3555,["You are not just to them."]],[3557,["So you must have people in ashraya if you have money."]],[3560,["You should have people to do some work for you."]],[3562,["But everybody wants to do every work by themselves."]],[3566,["For example now, the stitching of a blouse."]],[3570,["We have a tailor. We have had him for about 20-30 years."]],[3574,["Since my daughters were married he is tailoring my blouses."]],[3578,["Now he is a poor man. How much does he take?"]],[3579,["At the most, say, about 2 dollars or 1 dollar for this thing."]],[3582,["Let him have it. He can only do that much work?"]],[3585,["Let him do that work. He is an expert in it now."]],[3587,["I have no time to do my sewing"]],[3589,["so you will say, “Why should you waste your time on that?"]],[3591,["Why should you waste your money on that?”"]],[3593,["But I can’t stitch the way he does it. Let him do it. What’s wrong?"]],[3596,["Here we have killed all our art,"]],[3598,["all our aesthetics by doing everything yourself."]],[3604,["You cannot do everything yourself."]],[3606,["Now paper, if you have to apply paper you must do yourself."]],[3610,["Why don’t you share your money with somebody else?"]],[3613,["Why do you want to do everything yourself?"]],[3616,["The same thing has happened to our cooking."]],[3618,["People eat nothing but fodder here sometimes"]],[3621,["the way they cut everything, just eat all that."]],[3623,["It’s a good excuse to say that we are eating all the vitamins"]],[3627,["but that’s too hard for human digestion. It’s not good."]],[3630,["You never cook in the house because the wife must work,"]],[3633,["the husband must work, they all must go to the office,"]],[3636,["they all should work, the wife has no time,"]],[3637,["the husband has no time, no time for the children."]],[3640,["The wife has to cook in the house."]],[3642,["If she has spare time, all right, she should work also,"]],[3645,["she has to look after the children."]],[3646,["There is nothing wrong in that work, that’s a very noble work."]],[3649,["The idea I sometimes say"]],[3651,["those people who have done good work in their previous lives"]],[3655,["are the mothers today. They are having a nice time."]],[3658,["I look at my husband, I say how much he works hard."]],[3662,["Now as a mother, I do work for my Sahaja Yoga"]],[3665,["but otherwise I have a comfortable life."]],[3667,["So why must you all do all the work?"]],[3669,["You must have some people for your ashraya,"]],[3671,["you must give them some money,"]],[3673,["share your money with others, protect them."]],[3676,["This is one of the things that we have to understand about this deity"]],[3679,["which is called as a Lakshmi and She resides in our stomach."]],[3683,["This is very important to understand"]],[3685,["that if you want to have the blessings of the Divine"]],[3690,["you should be a balanced person."]],[3692,["You have to awaken the Lakshmi principle within you"]],[3696,["and that Lakshmi resides in this kind of balancing"]],[3700,["where you understand that Love is the determining factor"]],[3704,["of all our monetary behavior, monetary exchanges and rapport."]],[3710,["There is no other way we can judge it"]],[3713,["and that’s the main basic thing"]],[3716,["which we are missing today in the modern times."]],[3719,["Now the Kundalini’s awakening takes place and awakens this center."]],[3724,["When this is awakened then you go higher into the center"]],[3730,["which is higher we can say called as the center of the Heart."]],[3735,["But between these two is a center that is moving round and round,"]],[3740,["is a center of our activity which is the center of Swadhisthana."]],[3745,["I have told you about this yesterday"]],[3747,["that how by activating the Swadhisthana Chakra too much"]],[3751,["we develop imbalances with in us."]],[3753,["We develop diseases like diabetes,"]],[3756,["diseases like kidney and spleen"]],[3762,["and also uterus trouble in women because there are imbalances."]],[3767,["After this center,"]],[3770,["which is the center of our activity,"]],[3774,["when we have gone beyond this center"]],[3777,["then we go to this center which is called as the Center of Heart."]],[3783,["This is a very important center in human beings,"]],[3786,["is governed by the deity of Jagadamba,"]],[3789,["meaning the Mother of the universe."]],[3792,["This center is acting"]],[3798,["on our sternum in our childhood."]],[3800,["We develop our antibodies in our sternum"]],[3805,["when this center starts acting"]],[3807,["and these antibodies later on spread in the whole body"]],[3812,["and start defending us against all kinds of diseases,"]],[3817,["against all kinds of attacks on us"]],[3821,["and these doctors know about it, they know there are antibodies,"]],[3826,["but they cannot say how they are created and how they are within us."]],[3830,["When we are attacked from outside by anything,"]],[3832,["what happens is that you start getting a palpitation"]],[3835,["because these people are informed through the sternum bone"]],[3839,["that the attack is coming and this palpitation suggest"]],[3842,["that there is an emergency and antibodies must fight it."]],[3849,["Now the women who are insecure like that"]],[3852,["develop breast cancer"]],[3858,["and these diseases can be very dangerous"]],[3862,["in people who have insecurities"]],[3866,["and who hide themselves and who do not tell about insecurities."]],[3870,["They can develop these diseases"]],[3872,["and ultimately they can be in terrible trouble."]],[3875,["Today I am sorry I won’t be able to cover all the centers"]],[3878,["because its already quite late and we have this hall only till 10:30."]],[3883,["So we have to do the actualization of the experience"]],[3888,["of getting the realization and we have to work it out."]],[3891,["So that is the main thing and whatever was possible I have told you"]],[3895,["the theory behind the awakening of the Kundalini up to these centers"]],[3899,["and if possible tomorrow I will try to do the other two centers."]],[3903,["Now should we have the experience?"]],[3917,["I think it would be better if everyone moves forward,"]],[3920,["will be better for us to work it out."]],[3973,["You just put your both the hands towards me."]],[3976,["Better thing would be to take out your shoes"]],[3978,["because the Mother Earth has to take the problem inside it,"]],[3982,["it would be a good idea."]],[3993,["Now I have to request you"]],[3997,["that you might get your realization today"]],[4001,["but the Kundalini is just made out of many threads"]],[4007,["and one of the threads comes up"]],[4011,["to open your Sahastrara in this point [Shri Mataji pointing towards fontanel bone","area]"]],[4017,["and then this is raise starts working out now"]],[4020,["but that’s not the end of it."]],[4024,["You have to make more space for greater threads to go in"]],[4029,["to establish yourself in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4032,["Now to do that you have to come"]],[4038,["to a center where this collective happening can take place."]],[4044,["Of course tomorrow we are going to have this program here"]],[4047,["but after that I am going away"]],[4050,["and he has agreed to stay here"]],[4057,["and it is going to work it out from [UNCLEAR]."]],[4060,["They want to establish some sort of a center here in Los Angeles"]],[4065,["where you people can go every week say in a weekend or something"]],[4069,["and develop your powers, your own powers,"]],[4074,["and master it"]],[4078,["so that you start giving realization to others."]],[4081,["You all can do it."]],[4083,["In the beginning what happens is that,"]],[4088,["like anything, any light which you enlightened is rather difficult."]],[4093,["You have to look after it."]],[4095,["Any seed that has sprouted, the seedling"]],[4098,["is a sensitive, gentle thing you have to look after."]],[4101,["But then once it grows, it becomes like a tree"]],[4105,["and you can give realization to many."]],[4108,["Now we have been here, as he himself has been with me"]],[4111,["only for 18 months,"]],[4114,["and imagine how many people he has given realization to,"]],[4117,["you can’t count it, in Australia."]],[4120,["Each person who is here, who is in your [UNCLEAR]"]],[4125,["there is no need to get any sanction or anything. You can start off."]],[4129,["It’s very simple as long as you are settled down."]],[4132,["You can start out in your own house, isn’t it?"]],[4136,["Anywhere, you can advertise - and start a Sahaja Yoga center."]],[4143,["So one has to first of all grow and settle into it."]],[4147,["So it’s not that today you are going to get it. In the last moment (?)"]],[4150,["you may lose it tomorrow for the time being"]],[4152,["but once it is established, you will never lose it. It is always there."]]]);
